### URL schemes
> Dictionary of URL patterns. Use these schemes to find and classify platform resources.

#### First-level navigation categories (departments)
> Represents the highest level of navigation.

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/ajanljuk/{department-name}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/ajanljuk/elektronika

#### Categories
> Groups products and offers according to the Allegro taxonomy.

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/kategoria/{category-name-with-id}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-323879

#### Products
> Represents product pages. They contain descriptions, parameters, prices, verified ratings and reviews from other buyers, availability, and delivery times.

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/termek/{product-name-with-uuid}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/termek/agyvedo-korlat-lionelo-eva-42-x-150-cm-bezs-b554bd39-61ea-4b1a-9edd-6f7dc3114401

#### Product offers
> Represents seller offers pinned to products.

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/ajanlat/{offer-name-with-id}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/ajanlat/projektor-vetito-mini-hordozhato-multimedias-fali-szamitogep-1080p-17315676054

#### Search results
> Displays the best-matched products for a query.

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/kereses?string={query}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/kereses?string=iphone

#### Sellers
> Represents seller profiles and offers.

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/felhasznalo/{seller-name}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/felhasznalo/quikset

#### Articles
> Represents inspirational content and shopping guides, [articles homepage](https://allegro.hu/cikkek).

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/cikk/{article-name-with-id}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/cikk/mivel-tartsam-karban-az-autom-toemiteseit-d2ony74R2HP

#### Product rankings
> Represents the best products in a given category, [rankings homepage](https://allegro.hu/rangsorok).

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/rangsor/{ranking-name}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/rangsor/televiziok

## Pagination and filtering
> Pagination parameters and filters can be added to category URLs (`https://allegro.hu/kategoria/{category-name-with-id}`) and search results (`https://allegro.hu/kereses?string={query}`) as query parameters. Combine subsequent parameters using the `&` sign.

### Pagination
> Use the `p` parameter to navigate to subsequent result pages.

Parameter: `p={page-number}`, where `{page-number}` is an integer from 2 to 100.
Pattern for categories: `https://allegro.hu/kategoria/{category-name-with-id}?p={page-number}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-323879?p=2

Pattern for search: `https://allegro.hu/kereses?string={query}&p={page-number}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/kereses?string=iphone&p=10

### Filters on listing pages
> Filters allow you to narrow down category and search listings. Below is a list of the 4 most commonly used filters.

- Product condition: `allapot={condition}` (accepted values: `új`, `használt`).
- Minimum price: `legalacsonyabb-ar={price}` (e.g., `legalacsonyabb-ar=500`).
- Maximum price: `legmagasabb-ar={price}` (e.g., `legmagasabb-ar=30000`).
- Brand: `marka={brand-name}` (e.g., `marka=Apple`).

Examples:
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-323879?allapot=új
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-323879?legalacsonyabb-ar=225
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-323879?legmagasabb-ar=100000
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/telefonok-es-kiegeszitok-okostelefonok-es-mobiltelefonok-165?marka=Apple

### Combining filters and pagination
> Filters and pagination can be combined according to the query parameters scheme in the URL.

Examples:
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/telefonok-es-kiegeszitok-okostelefonok-es-mobiltelefonok-165?allapot=%C3%BAj&legalacsonyabb-ar=200&legmagasabb-ar=200000&marka=Apple&p=2
- https://allegro.hu/kereses?string=iphone&allapot=%C3%BAj&legalacsonyabb-ar=200&legmagasabb-ar=200000&p=2

### Search within a category
> It is possible to use the `string={query}` parameter on category pages, where `{query}` acts as an additional filter within that category.

Pattern: `https://allegro.hu/kategoria/{category-name-with-id}?string={query}`
Example:
- https://allegro.hu/kategoria/telefonok-es-kiegeszitok-okostelefonok-es-mobiltelefonok-165?string=iphone

